  "notes": "{重|かさ}ねる means to pile up or stack (literally), and to repeat or accumulate (figuratively).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{重|かさ}なる→重なる：02038_kasanaru⟧ (intransitive, \"to pile up\")\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{重|かさ}ねて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates an ongoing state of having been stacked, or continued repetition.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{皿|さら}→皿：00883_sara⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{重|かさ}ねる: to stack plates\n- ⟦{努力|どりょく}→努力：03490_doryoku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{重|かさ}ねる: to make repeated efforts\n- ⟦{年|とし}→年：00486_toshi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{重|かさ}ねる: to grow older (lit. pile up years)\n- ⟦{経験|けいけん}→経験：01179_keiken⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{重|かさ}ねる: to accumulate experience\n- ⟦{話|はな}し{合|あ}い→話し合い：14176_hanashiai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{重|かさ}ねる: to have repeated discussions\n\nThe figurative sense emphasizes gradual accumulation over time.",
